== diags.diag/unique-borrowed-mutation
BYN2783 10:23 `xs` borrows from what it was bound to and cannot be changed or moved
  label `append` modifies it
  help change the subject itself, or work on a `.copy(to: alloc)`; a loop or pattern variable of a unique type borrows from its subject
BYN2783 12:27 `xs` borrows from what it was bound to and cannot be changed or moved
  label moving it would take the value out of what it borrows from
  help move or copy the value it was bound to instead
BYN2783 15:35 `items` borrows from what it was bound to and cannot be changed or moved
  label `append` modifies it
  help change the subject itself, or work on a `.copy(to: alloc)`; a loop or pattern variable of a unique type borrows from its subject
